---
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
import { SITE_NAME, SITE_URL } from "../lib/site";
---

<BaseLayout title="Privacy Policy" description={`${SITE_NAME} privacy policy.`} noindex={true}>
  <div class="wrap">
    <article class="prose">
      <h1>Privacy Policy</h1>
      <p><em>Last updated: October 11, 2026</em></p>
      <h2>What we collect</h2>
      <p>
        {SITE_NAME} does not require an account to use its guides or calculators. Optional newsletter signup collects an email address. Our calculators run entirely in your browser —
        nothing you enter leaves your device.
      </p>
      <h2>Email signup</h2>
    <p>If you join the optional newsletter, we collect your email address and store it with Resend, our email service provider, in this site's newsletter segment. This is separate from calculator inputs. Signup is for printables and at most one short email a week. Email delivery has not launched yet.</p>
    <p>Your signup remains stored until it is removed. You can ask for access or deletion by contacting sam@robotlawnmowerguide.com. When email delivery launches, every newsletter will include an unsubscribe link. Unsubscribing stops future newsletters but does not itself delete the stored contact; ask us for deletion if you want the contact removed. We do not sell newsletter addresses.</p>
      <h2>Cookies and analytics</h2>
      <p>
        We use <a href="https://posthog.com" rel="noopener">PostHog</a> to
        understand which pages are useful. It records page views, outbound
        and affiliate link clicks (so we know which recommendations help),
        and web performance metrics (page load timing and Web Vitals such as
        LCP, INP, and CLS). PostHog stores a cookie or local-storage entry
        to distinguish visits; session replays are disabled and we honor
        your browser's Do Not Track setting.
      </p>
      <p>
        Outbound links to Amazon carry an affiliate tag so qualifying
        purchases can be attributed; Amazon's own privacy policy applies on
        amazon.com.
      </p>
      <h2>Affiliate disclosure</h2>
      <p>
        {SITE_NAME} is a participant in the Amazon Services LLC Associates
        Program, an affiliate advertising program designed to provide a means
        for sites to earn advertising fees by advertising and linking to Amazon.com.
      </p>
      <h2>Contact</h2>
      <p>Privacy questions: hello@{new URL(SITE_URL).hostname}</p>
    </article>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>
